  "title": "epan: Don't change ports in error packets, similar to addresses",
  "description": "Addresses are already restored to their original values after\nprocessing an error packet (and columns aren't changed.) Do the\nsame for ports as well. This affects the port columns, because\nthe port columns are filled in from the packet_info struct at\nthe end of processing.\n\nFix #19713",
